WEBVTT

00:13:59.040 --> 00:14:00.616
And the angels shout,

00:14:00.640 --> 00:14:04.176
"Escape to the mountain.
Whatever you do, don't look back,"

00:14:04.200 --> 00:14:08.136
just as God starts raining down fire
on Sodom and Gomorrah.

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:10.776
I can't figure out how Gomorrah
got dragged into this.

00:14:10.800 --> 00:14:13.776
But Lot and his folks are running,

00:14:13.800 --> 00:14:15.456
fleeing all that destruction,

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:18.456
kicking up dust while the Lord
rains down death,

00:14:18.480 --> 00:14:23.760
and then, for some reason,
Lot's wife looks back.

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:27.160
God turns her into a pillar of salt.

00:14:28.600 --> 00:14:32.280
"Remember Lot's wife," Jesus says.